.Glossary.Telepathy]</p>"},"publication":{"license":"OGL","remaster":false,"title":"Pathfinder Bestiary"},"rules":[],"slug":"telepathy","traits":{"rarity":"common","value":["aura","magical"]},"_migration":{"version":0.959,"previous":null}},"type":"action","effects":[],"_key":"!actors.items!hfCfDNxeU04hFSVk.F5P8duLKzS9B2F6F"},{"_id":"jtyp8z5htu8nlcsp","img":"systems/pf2e/icons/actions/Passive.webp","name":"Unsubstantiated Consciousness","sort":400000,"system":{"actionType":{"value":"passive"},"actions":{"value":null},"category":"interaction","description":{"value":"<p>When an imperfect automaton succeeds at a Will save, it gets a critical success instead. When it fails at a Will save, it gets a critical failure instead.</p>"},"publication":{"license":"OGL","remaster":false,"title":""},"rules":[{"adjustment":{"success":"one-degree-better"},"key":"AdjustDegreeOfSuccess","selector":"will","type":"save"},{"adjustment":{"failure":"one-degree-worse"},"key":"AdjustDegreeOfSuccess","selector":"will","type":"save"}],"slug":null,"traits":{"rarity":"common","value":[]},"_migration":{"version":0.959,"previous":null}},"type":"action","_stats":{"coreVersion":"14.361","systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"8.5.0","compendiumSource":null},"effects":[],"_key":"!actors.items!hfCfDNxeU04hFSVk.jtyp8z5htu8nlcsp"},{"_id":"4nwaadngcx3evt3a","img":"systems/pf2e/icons/actions/TwoActions.webp","name":"Empty Wail","sort":500000,"system":{"actionType":{"value":"action"},"actions":{"value":2},"category":"offensive","description":{"value":"<p>The imperfect automaton utters a mournful cry in a @Template[cone|distance:30]. The cry deals @Damage[4d6[mental]|options:area-damage] damage to all creatures in the area (@Check[will|dc:22|options:area-effect,damaging-effect] save). The imperfect automaton can't use its Empty Wail again for [[/gmr 1d4 #Recharge Empty Wail]]{1d4 rounds}.</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Critical Success</strong> The creature is unaffected.</p>\n<p><strong>Success</strong> The creature takes half damage.</p>\n<p><strong>Failure</strong> The creature takes full damage and is @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.e1XGnhKNSQIm5IXg]{Stupefied 1} for [[/gmr 1d4+1 #rounds]]{1d4+1 rounds}.</p>\n<p><strong>Critical Failure</strong> The creature takes double damage and is stupefied 1 for 1d4+1 rounds and @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.dfCMdR4wnpbYNTix]{Stunned 1}.</p>"},"publication":{"license":"OGL","remaster":false,"title":""},"rules":[],"slug":null,"traits":{"rarity":"common","value":["auditory","emotion","mental"]},"_migration":{"version":0.959,"previous":null}},"type":"action","_stats":{"coreVersion":"14.361","systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"8.5.0","compendiumSource":null},"effects":[],"_key":"!actors.items!hfCfDNxeU04hFSVk.4nwaadngcx3evt3a"},{"_id":"xs1kc35q6z95frop","img":"systems/pf2e/icons/actions/Passive.webp","name":"Impassioned Strikes","sort":600000,"system":{"actionType":{"value":"passive"},"actions":{"value":null},"category":"offensive","description":{"value":"<p>While the imperfect automaton is affected by an emotion effect, its fist Strikes deal 1d6 additional mental damage.</p>"},"publication":{"license":"OGL","remaster":false,"title":""},"rules":[{"domain":"damage","key":"RollOption","label":"Automaton is affected by an effect with the emotion trait","option":"impassioned-strikes","toggleable":true},{"damageType":"mental","diceNumber":1,"dieSize":"d6","key":"DamageDice","predicate":["impassioned-strikes"],"selector":"strike-damage"}],"slug":null,"traits":{"rarity":"common","value":[]},"_migration":{"version":0.959,"previous":null}},"type":"action","_stats":{"coreVersion":"14.361","systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"8.5.0","compendiumSource":null},"effects":[],"_key":"!actors.items!hfCfDNxeU04hFSVk.xs1kc35q6z95frop"},{"_id":"4zyl6wd0lae8unq2","img":"systems/pf2e/icons/actions/OneAction.webp","name":"Mortal Reflection","sort":700000,"system":{"actionType":{"value":"action"},"actions":{"value":1},"category":"offensive","description":{"value":"<p><strong>Requirements</strong> The imperfect automaton has a creature @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.kWc1fhmv9LBiTuei]{Grabbed} or @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.VcDeM8A5oI6VqhbM]{Restrained}</p><hr />\n<p><strong>Effect</strong> The imperfect automaton draws upon the target's emotions to recall a semblance of mortal feeling, gaining a +5-foot status bonus to its Speed for 1 minute. If the grabbed or restrained creature has an ongoing emotion or mental effect with a counteract rank of 4 or lower, the imperfect automaton can gain a copy of that effect that lasts for 1 minute.</p>\n<p>@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.bestiary-effects.Item.vUFIbQ74jz22rOXw]{Effect: Mortal Reflection}</p>"},"publication":{"license":"OGL","remaster":false,"title":""},"rules":[],"slug":null,"traits":{"rarity":"common","value":["emotion"]},"_migration":{"version":0.959,"previous":null}},"type":"action","_stats":{"coreVersion":"14.361","systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"8.5.0","compendiumSource":null},"effects":[],"_key":"!actors.items!hfCfDNxeU04hFSVk.4zyl6wd0lae8unq2"},{"_id":"bx38jxjHpbtTvxcl","_stats":{"coreVersion":"14.361","systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"8.5.0","compendiumSource":"Compendium.pf2e.bestiary-ability-glossary-srd.Item.Tkd8sH4pwFIPzqTr"},"img":"systems/pf2e/icons/actions/OneAction.webp","name":"Grab","sort":800000,"system":{"actionType":{"value":"action"},"actions":{"value":1},"category":"offensive","description":{"value":"<p>@Localize[PF2E.NPC.Abilities.Glossary.Grab]</p>"},"publication":{"license":"OGL","remaster":false,"title":"Pathfinder Bestiary"},"rules":[],"slug":"grab","traits":{"rarity":"common","value":[]},"_migration":{"version":0.959,"previous":null}},"type":"action","effects":[],"_key":"!actors.items!hfCfDNxeU04hFSVk.bx38jxjHpbtTvxcl"}],"name":"Imperfect Automaton","system":{"abilities":{"cha":{"mod":2},"con":{"mod":4},"dex":{"mod":3},"int":{"mod":3},"str":{"mod":5},"wis":{"mod":0}},"attributes":{"ac":{"details":"","value":23},